{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03070",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.67,
      "end_seconds": 6.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.05,
      "end_seconds": 11.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.39,
      "end_seconds": 26.3,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "Okay, so mainly pain in my breastbone wound. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.82,
      "end_seconds": 30.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Right, how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.91,
      "end_seconds": 42.56,
      "duration_seconds": 10.65,
      "text": "It's been about a month, I'm fairly sure. I've been putting this off for weeks. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.14,
      "end_seconds": 52.25,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.35,
      "end_seconds": 60.23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "Right, yes, coughing. That makes it worse. It's once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.48,
      "end_seconds": 63.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.61,
      "end_seconds": 75.53,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get swollen ankles as well. Let me think, the swollen ankles? That's been for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.24,
      "end_seconds": 93.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain on exertion or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.67,
      "end_seconds": 96.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.43,
      "end_seconds": 100.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Right, is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.98,
      "end_seconds": 106.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Okay, so that's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.45,
      "end_seconds": 112.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "So, has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.37,
      "end_seconds": 120.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.95,
      "end_seconds": 122.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.53,
      "end_seconds": 125.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.88,
      "end_seconds": 128.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.18,
      "end_seconds": 132.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.09,
      "end_seconds": 134.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.12,
      "end_seconds": 138.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.48,
      "end_seconds": 149.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Alright, do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.96,
      "end_seconds": 152.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.0,
      "end_seconds": 158.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.98,
      "end_seconds": 162.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "No, um, no conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.54,
      "end_seconds": 166.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.58,
      "end_seconds": 169.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.76,
      "end_seconds": 173.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Right, are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.62,
      "end_seconds": 177.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Well, my father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.93,
      "end_seconds": 190.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.8,
      "end_seconds": 206.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.75,
      "end_seconds": 227.58,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 115 over 76, respiratory rate 17, heart rate 84. And temperature is 36.8 degrees, SpO2 97 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.23,
      "end_seconds": 233.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.4,
      "end_seconds": 235.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.28,
      "end_seconds": 237.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.15,
      "end_seconds": 265.81,
      "duration_seconds": 9.66,
      "text": "The chest wound has healed, the breastbone is stable, and the vein-harvest wound on the leg is a little swollen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.02,
      "end_seconds": 277.13,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "You can relax now. Okay, thinking it through, I think we're dealing with recovering well after bypass surgery at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.02,
      "end_seconds": 304.8,
      "duration_seconds": 12.78,
      "text": "I want an ECG done, that's for post-operative review. Blood tests is what I'd like next, for post-operative review. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.73,
      "end_seconds": 306.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.57,
      "end_seconds": 332.18,
      "duration_seconds": 23.61,
      "text": "Walk daily, no heavy lifting for six weeks and no driving until you are cleared. Let's get you seen by the cardiac rehabilitation team, I'll arrange the letter. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently. Let's plan a check in six weeks. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.88,
      "end_seconds": 336.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.98,
      "end_seconds": 339.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}